## Node.js Web App for MLM Advertisement

**Product:** ZenTea, a herbal tea company offering personalized blends.

**Web App:** zen-tea.com

**Features:**

* **Product Builder:** Allows users to customize their own blends by selecting different herbs and spices.
* **Multi-Level Marketing (MLM) Platform:** Enables users to recruit others and earn commissions on their sales.
* **Order Fulfillment:** Manages the entire order fulfillment process, including payment processing and shipping.

**Node.js App:**

```js
const express = require('express');
const app = express();

const products = [
  { name: 'Relaxing Evening Blend', ingredients: ['Chamomile', 'Lavender', 'Valerian'] },
  // Add other product definitions
];

app.get('/products', (req, res) => {
  res.send(products);
});

app.post('/build-product', (req, res) => {
  const newProduct = req.body;
  products.push(newProduct);
  res.send(newProduct);
});

app.post('/order', (req, res) => {
  const order = req.body;
  // Process order and calculate total cost
  const totalCost = calculateTotalCost(order);
  order.totalCost = totalCost;
  res.send(order);
});

app.listen(3000);
```

